<Base title="Privacy | Stopwatch" description="What Stopwatch collects, the cookies its advertising uses, what stays on your phone, and your choices." path="privacy">
<main class="wrap" style="max-width:760px">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Stopwatch has no accounts and no forms, and does not ask for or store personal information on its servers.</p>
  <h2>What stays on your phone</h2>
  <p>Saved stops and routes are kept in your browser’s own storage and never sent anywhere. Timetables you open are cached by your browser so they work offline. “Stops near me” uses your location only inside your browser to sort stops by distance; it is never sent to Stopwatch.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>This site shows ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other websites. You can turn off personalised advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="nofollow">Google’s Ad Settings</a>, and read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p>
  <h2>Maps</h2>
  <p>When you open a map, map images are loaded from OpenFreeMap, which receives a standard web request (such as your IP address) to send them.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is served by Cloudflare, which keeps standard request logs to operate and protect the service.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions: <a href="https://shivrajsinh.in" rel="me">shivrajsinh.in</a>.</p>
  <p class="small muted">Last updated 4 October 2026.</p>
</main>
</Base>
